// Gap 7: the "..." marker must be the last parameter of a user "extern fun".
// Nothing may follow it, so this declaration is a parse error rather than a
// signature that silently ignores what comes after. It lives here, in the
// directory of programs that are deliberately not valid Kelp, so the formatter
// is right to refuse it.
pub extern fun kelp_va_sum(count: i32, ..., extra: i32).R: i32
